# License status

HelioMC is a fork of [McSH](https://github.com/kalakaritzu/mcsh).

The upstream McSH project does **not** currently declare a license, and this
fork does not grant any additional rights beyond those you already have under
applicable law and the upstream project's terms.

In practical terms:

- No open-source license is granted by this repository yet.
- All rights are reserved by the respective authors.
- You are responsible for confirming that you have the necessary rights before
  redistributing HelioMC or any derivative work.
- If the upstream project adopts a license, this fork will adopt compatible
  terms and update this file.

This file is a statement of licensing status, not a license grant.

## Third-party components

HelioMC depends on third-party packages and services, each governed by its own
license:

- [Spectre.Console](https://github.com/spectreconsole/spectre.console) — MIT
- [Figgle](https://github.com/drewnoakes/figgle) — MIT
- [fNbt](https://github.com/fragmer/fNbt) — MIT
- [authlib-injector](https://github.com/yushijinhun/authlib-injector) — AGPL-3.0
  (downloaded at runtime, not bundled)
- Minecraft, Mojang, Microsoft, Ely.by, and Modrinth are trademarks or services
  of their respective owners.

See the upstream repositories for the exact terms of each dependency.
